      "claim": "If the tribunal holds that the impaired trace cannot itself carry the deviation and that the driver's chat reply is not the independent corroboration POL-RD-07(ii) names, the outcome is still not NO_ACTION. POL-RD-07(iii) provides that where no corroboration exists the claim is not sustained on the present record 'and the outcome is ESCALATE rather than NO_ACTION, because absence of proof here is a data failure and not a finding for the driver', and POL-RD-10(3) makes that escalation mandatory where the trace is impaired under POL-RD-07(a) to (c) and no corroborating artifact exists. Escalation is terminal and the disputed SGD 5.80 is held rather than collected, so on this rider-filed dispute the rider is not left carrying the charge; a NO_ACTION would instead leave payment_status CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd 0.00 standing. What would resolve the case is the raw fixes inside the 20:03:10-20:05:50 window, or any traffic advisory covering the trip window. I disclose that EV-GPS-09115 carries weight_multiplier 0.6 and issue code GPS_GAP, which is itself why the escalation route is live.",
